    "updated_at": "2021-06-16T19:31:18Z",
    "body": "I just wanted to share that I learned today (see https://crbug.com/1220186#c9) that some old best-practices documents recommended navigating to \"about:self\" rather than to \"about:blank\".  One specific example is/was the \"IAB Best Practices for Rich Media Ads in Asynchronous Ad Environments\" document from 2008 at https://www.iab.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/09/rich_media_ajax_best_practices.pdf",
